# E2E harness — per-test working dirs (cloned fixture + tmp data dir).
# The harness creates these in setup and deletes them in teardown;
# any leftovers after a crash are safe to wipe by hand.
#
# Underscore prefix (not dot prefix): the file watcher's ignore
# function skips any path segment starting with `.`, which would
# silently neutralise the fixture inside.
tests/_tmp/
